# Tech Stack

## Application
| Layer | Technology | Notes |
|-------|-----------|-------|
| Frontend | Next.js (React) | App router, TypeScript strict mode |
| Backend | Python | FastAPI for API layer |
| Database | PostgreSQL on AWS RDS | via SQLAlchemy ORM |
| Vector DB | pgvector (PostgreSQL extension) | RAG retrieval — abstraction layer wraps it |
| AI access | AWS Bedrock | NEVER call Anthropic SDK directly |
| Primary AI model | Claude 3.5 Sonnet | via Bedrock — other models added via routing |
| File storage | AWS S3 | Raw files + S3 versioning enabled |
| Auth | NextAuth.js | Email/password for MVP |
| Async processing | AWS SQS + Python worker | Document indexing, workflow execution |
| Real-time | Server-Sent Events (SSE) | AI streaming + workflow status updates |
| Infrastructure | SST on AWS CDK (Python) | NEVER use raw CDK or console clicks |

## Development environment
- Remote EC2 t3.xlarge, Ubuntu 24 LTS
- OrbStack for local Docker containers (PostgreSQL + pgvector)
- SST dev mode for AWS services (Bedrock, S3, SQS) — connects to real AWS, no mocks
- Cursor via SSH remote — all execution on EC2

