## What NOT to use
- ❌ Never call `anthropic` SDK directly — always use `boto3` with Bedrock
- ❌ Never use `LocalStack` — SST dev mode connects to real AWS
- ❌ Never use `Docker Desktop` — OrbStack only on EC2
- ❌ Never use `npm` or `yarn` — use `pnpm` for JS packages
- ❌ Never use `pip` directly — use `Poetry` for Python packages
- ❌ Never use `Black` or `Flake8` — Ruff handles both
- ❌ Never use `WidthType.PERCENTAGE` in docx generation
- ❌ Never hardcode AWS credentials — use AWS Secrets Manager via boto3
